---
const PLAY_URL = "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.romel.gana4";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16 pt-14 sm:px-6 sm:pt-20">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <span
        class="glass inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-soft"
      >
        Cuatro en línea
      </span>

      <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.02] sm:text-6xl">
        Conecta 4 y <span class="text-gradient">gana</span> la copa
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-txt-soft">
        Juega <strong class="font-semibold text-txt">contra la máquina</strong> en tres niveles o
        desafía a alguien en
        <strong class="font-semibold text-txt">multijugador por WiFi local</strong>. Sin registro,
        sin cuentas, todo desde tu dispositivo.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={PLAY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-accent px-6 py-4 font-display font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-accent/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-soft hover:text-ink"
        >
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="M3.6 2.3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-.6 1.2v17c0 .5.2.9.6 1.2l9.1-9.7L3.6 2.3Zm11 8.1 2.9-3.1-9.4-5.3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-.6-.1l7.1 8.5Zm0 3.2-7.1 8.5c.2 0 .4 0 .6-.1l9.4-5.3-2.9-3.1Zm5.5-3.4-2.4-1.3-3.1 3.3 3.1 3.3 2.4-1.3c.9-.5.9-2.5 0-3Z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          Disponible en Google Play
        </a>

        <a
          href="/privacidad"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 px-6 py-4 font-display font-semibold text-txt-soft transition hover:border-accent/60 hover:text-txt"
        >
          Política de privacidad
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-10 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-txt-muted">Niveles</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-txt">3</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-txt-muted">Modos</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-txt">3</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-txt-muted">Registro</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-txt">Ninguno</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="glass overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-3">
        <img
          src="/feature-graphic-1024x500.png"
          alt="Gana4, cuatro en línea"
          width="1024"
          height="500"
          class="h-auto w-full rounded-2xl"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-4 hidden gap-2 sm:flex"
      >
        <span class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-piece-red shadow-lg shadow-piece-red/40"></span>
        <span class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-piece-yellow shadow-lg shadow-piece-yellow/40"></span>
        <span class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-piece-red shadow-lg shadow-piece-red/40"></span>
        <span class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full bg-piece-yellow shadow-lg shadow-piece-yellow/40"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
